hadiths[97]{hadithnumber,text}:
"228","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey ghar ki chhat kholi gai jabke main Makkah mein tha. To Jibreel naazil huey aur mera seena khola, phir use Aab-e-Zamzam se dhoya. Phir soney ka tasht laaey jo hikmat aur imaan se bhara hua tha. To use merey seeney mein daala phir use band kar diya. Phir mera haath pakda aur mujhey Aasmaan-e-Duniya ki taraf ley gaey. Phir jab main Aasmaan-e-Duniya par aaya to Jibreel ne aasmaan key daaroghey se kaha: Kholo. Us ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Jibreel hain. Us ne kaha: Kya tumharey sath koi hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, merey sath Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. To us ne kaha: Kya unhey bulaaya gaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Phir jab us ne khola to ham Aasmaan-e-Duniya par chadhey. Phir aik aadmi baitha hua tha jiskey daaen taraf jamaatein aur baaen taraf jamaatein thein. Jab wo apne daaen taraf dekhta to hansta, aur jab apne baaen taraf dekhta to rota. To us ne kaha: Nek Nabi aur nek betey ko khush aamdeed! Main ne Jibreel se kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Aadam hain aur ye jamaatein unkey daaen aur baaen unki aulaad ki roohein hain. To un mein se daaen taraf waley Jannat waley hain, aur baaen taraf wali jamaatein aag waley hain. Phir jab wo apne daaen taraf dekhta hai to hansta hai aur jab apne baaen taraf dekhta hai to rota hai. Yahan tak ke wo mujhey doosrey aasmaan tak ley gaey. To us ne uskey daaroghey se kaha: Kholo. To uskey daaroghey ne use waisa kaha jaisa pehley ne kaha tha. To us ne khol diya. Anas ne kaha: To unhon-ne zikr kya ke unhon-ne aasmaanon mein Aadam aur Idrees aur Musa aur Isa aur Ibrahim (Alaihimussalam) ko paaya. Aur unkey thikaanon ki kefiyat saabit na ki, magar ye ke unhon-ne zikr kya ke unhon-ne Aadam ko Aasmaan-e-Duniya mein paaya aur Ibrahim ko chhathey aasmaan mein. Anas ne kaha: Phir jab Jibreel Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ley kar Idrees key paas se guzrey to unhon-ne kaha: Nek Nabi aur nek bhai ko khush aamdeed! To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Idrees hain. Phir main Musa key paas se guzra to unhon-ne kaha: Nek Nabi aur nek bhai ko khush aamdeed! Main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Musa hain. Phir main Isa key paas se guzra to unhon-ne kaha: Nek bhai aur nek Nabi ko khush aamdeed! Main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Isa hain. Phir main Ibrahim key paas se guzra to unhon-ne kaha: Nek Nabi aur nek betey ko khush aamdeed! Main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Ibrahim hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Ibn Abbas aur Abu Habba Ansaari (Raziallahu anhum) kehtey they: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir mujhey upar ley jaaya gaya yahan tak ke main aisi bulandi par zaahir hua jahaan main qalamon key likhney ki aawaaz sunta tha. Anas bin Maalik ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To Allah ne meri ummat par pachaas namazein farz kein. To main usey ley kar wapas aaya yahan tak ke main Musa key paas se guzra. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ne tumhari ummat par kya farz kya hai? Main ne kaha: Pachaas namazein farz kein. Unhon-ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf wapas jao, beshak tumhari ummat iski taaqat nahi rakkhti. To main ne rujoo kya aur us ne aadha kam kar diya. To main Musa ki taraf wapas aaya. Main ne kaha: Us ne aadha kam kar diya. To unhon-ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf rujoo karo, beshak tumhari ummat taaqat nahi rakkhti. To main ne rujoo kya aur us ne aadha kam kar diya. To main unki taraf wapas aaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf rujoo karo, beshak tumhari ummat iski taaqat nahi rakkhti. To main ne us se rujoo kya. To us ne farmaya: Wo paanch hain aur wo pachaas hain, merey paas baat badli nahi jaati. To main Musa ki taraf wapas aaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf rujoo karo. To main ne kaha: Main apne Rab se sharma gaya. Phir wo mujhey ley kar chala yahan tak ke mujhey Sidrat-ul-Muntaha tak pahunchaaya aur use aise rangon ne dhaanp liya jinhey main nahi jaanta kya hain. Phir mujhey Jannat mein daakhil kya gaya. Phir us mein motiyon key haar they aur uski mitti musk thi. (Bukhari: 349)"
"229","[AI-translation] Aisha Ummul Momineen (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Allah ne namaz farz ki jab use farz kya do do rakatein, hazar aur safar mein. To safar ki namaz (usi par) baaqi rakkhi gai aur hazar ki namaz mein izaafa kar diya gaya. (Bukhari: 350)"
"230","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik kapdey mein namaz padhi jabke uskey donon kinaaron ko mukhaalif (kandhon par) kar liya tha. (Bukhari: 354)"
"231","[AI-translation] Umm Haani bint Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Fatah key saal Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne aath rakatein padhein jabke aik kapdey mein lipt-tey huey they. Phir jab Aap phirey to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri maan key betey ne gumaan kya hai ke wo aik aadmi ko qatl karega jisey main ne panaah di hai, fulaan Ibn Hubaira. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham ne usey panaah di jisey tum ne panaah di ae Umm Haani! Umm Haani ne kaha: Aur wo Chaasht (ka waqt) tha. (Bukhari: 353-357)"
"232","[AI-translation] Umm Haani bint Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Fatah key saal Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne aath rakatein padhein jabke aik kapdey mein lipt-tey huey they. Phir jab Aap phirey to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri maan key betey ne gumaan kya hai ke wo aik aadmi ko qatl karega jisey main ne panaah di hai, fulaan Ibn Hubaira. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham ne usey panaah di jisey tum ne panaah di ae Umm Haani! Umm Haani ne kaha: Aur wo Chaasht (ka waqt) tha. (Bukhari: 353-357)"
"233","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik poochhney waley ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik kapdey mein namaz key baarey mein poochha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum sab key paas do kapdey hain? (Bukhari: 358)"
"234","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi aik kapdey mein namaz na padhey jabke uskey kandhon par kuchh na ho. (Bukhari: 359)"
"235","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo aik kapdey mein namaz padhey to use apney donon kinaaron ko mukhaalif (kandhon par) karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 360)"
"236","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Aap key baaz safaron mein nikla. To main raat ko apne kisi kaam key liye aaya aur Aap ko namaz padhtey huey paaya jabke mujh par aik kapda tha. To main us mein lapta gaya aur Aap key pehlu mein namaz padhi. Phir jab Aap phirey to farmaya: Raat ko chalna kaisa raha ae Jaabir? To main ne Aap ko apni haajat bataai. Phir jab main faarigh hua to Aap ne farmaya: Ye lapetna kaisa tha jo main ne dekha? Main ne kaha: Kapda tha. Aap ne farmaya: Phir agar wo kushaada ho to us mein lapto. Aur agar wo tang ho to use tehband banaao. (Bukhari: 361)"
"237","[AI-translation] Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padhtey they jabke apne tehbandon ko apni gardano par bachchon ki tarah baandhey huey hotey. Aur auraton se kaha jaata tha: Apne sar na uthao yahan tak ke mard baithney mein baraabar ho jaaein. (Bukhari: 362)"
"238","[AI-translation] Mugheera bin Shoaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Mugheera! Mashkiza uthao. To main ne use uthaaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaley yahan tak ke mujh se chhup gaey aur apni haajat poori ki jabke Aap par Shaami jubba tha. To Aap ne uski aasteen se apna haath nikaalna chaaha to wo tang thi. To Aap ne apna haath uskey neechey se nikaala. To main ne Aap par paani daala aur Aap ne namaz key wuzu jaisa wuzu kya aur moozon par masah kya, phir namaz padhi. (Bukhari: 363)"
"239","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey sath Kaaba key liye patthar uthaatey they jabke Aap par Aap ka tehband tha. To Aap key chacha Abbas ne Aap se kaha: Ae merey bhatijey! Kaash tum apna tehband khol do aur use pattharon key neechey apne kandhon par rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne use khola aur use apne kandhon par rakkha. To Aap behosh ho kar gir padey. To uskey baad Aap kabhi nangey na dekhey gaey. (Bukhari: 364)"
"240","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sammaa ki tarah lapetney se aur is se mana kya ke aadmi aik kapdey mein ghutney khadey kar key baithey jabke uski sharmgaah par us mein se kuchh na ho. (Bukhari: 367)"
"241","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do beon se mana kya: Chhooney aur phenkney (wali be) se. Aur is se ke sammaa ki tarah laptey aur aadmi aik kapdey mein ghutney khadey kar key baithey. (Bukhari: 368)"
"242","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne mujhey us Hajj mein bheja, Yaum-un-Nahr ko Mina mein elaan karney walon mein, ham Mina mein elaan kartey they: Ke is saal key baad koi mushrik Hajj na karey aur na Bait ka tawaaf nangey karey. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali ko apne peechey sawaar kya aur unhey Baraat key elaan ka hukm diya. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: To Ali ne hamaarey sath Mina walon mein Yaum-un-Nahr ko elaan kya: Is saal key baad koi mushrik Hajj na kareyga aur na Bait ka tawaaf nangey kareyga. (Bukhari: 369)"
"243","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar par hamla kya. To ham ne uskey paas andherey mein Subah ki namaz padhi. To Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sawaar huey aur Abu Talha sawaar huey aur main Abu Talha key peechey sawaar tha. To Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar ki gali mein (sawaari) daudaaee jabke mera ghutna Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan ko chhoo raha tha. Phir Aap ne tehband apni raan se hataaya yahan tak ke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan ki safedi dekh raha tha. Phir jab Aap basti mein daakhil huey to farmaya: Allahu Akbar! Khaibar veeraan hui. Beshak jab ham kisi qaum key aangan mein utartey hain to daraaey gaey logon ki subah buri hoti hai. Aap ne use teen martaba kaha. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur qaum apne kaamon ki taraf nikli aur unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad aur Khamis yaani lashkar. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham ne use zabardasti haasil kya. To qaidi jama kiye gaey. To Dihya Kalbi (Raziallahu anhu) aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Mujhey qaidiyon mein se londi dijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur londi lo. To unhon-ne Safiya bint Huyayy ko liya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Aap ne Dihya ko Safiya bint Huyayy dey di jo Quraiza aur Nazeer ki sardaar hain. Wo Aap key siwa kisi key laaeq nahi hain. Aap ne farmaya: Use uskey sath bulaao. To wo usey ley kar aaya. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dekha to farmaya: Qaidiyon mein se uskey siwa londi lo. Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey aazaad kar diya aur us se nikaah kar liya aur uska mehar usey aazaad karna banaaya. Yahan tak ke jab Aap raastey mein they to Umm Sulaim ne usey Aap key liye tayyaar kya aur raat ko usey Aap ko tohfey mein diya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dulha ban kar subah ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Jiskey paas kuchh ho wo use ley kar aaey. Aur dastarkhwaan bichaaya. To aadmi khajoor ley kar aaya aur aadmi ghee ley kar aaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur mera khayaal hai ke unhon-ne sattu ka zikr kya. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne hais banaaya. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka waleema tha. (Bukhari: 371)"
"244","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fajr padhtey they aur Aap key sath momin auraton mein se auratein haazir hotein jabke apni chaadaron mein lipti hui hotein. Phir apne gharon ki taraf wapas jaatein aur unhey koi na pehchaanta. (Bukhari: 372)"
"245","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisi chaadar mein namaz padhi jis mein nishaan they. To Aap ne uskey nishaanon ko aik nazar dekha. Phir jab Aap phirey to farmaya: Meri ye chaadar Abu Jahm key paas ley jao aur mujhey Abu Jahm ki bina nishaan wali chaadar laa do. Beshak us ne abhi meri namaz se mujhey ghafil kar diya. (Bukhari: 373)"
"246","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aisha ki aik qiraam (naqshdaar parda) tha jis se unhon-ne apne ghar ka pehlu dhaanpa hua tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apna ye qiraam ham se hata do. Beshak uski tasweerein meri namaz mein merey saamney aati rehti hain. (Bukhari: 374)"
"247","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko resham ka farruj tohfey mein diya gaya. To Aap ne use pehna aur us mein namaz padhi, phir phirey aur use zor se utaar diya goya usey naapasand kartey huey. Aur farmaya: Ye muttaqiyon key laaeq nahi hai. (Bukhari: 375)"
"248","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko chamdey key surkh qubbey mein dekha. Aur main ne Bilaal ko dekha ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key wuzu (ka paani) liya. Aur main ne logon ko dekha ke wo us wuzu (key paani) ki taraf daud rahey they. To jo us mein se kuchh paata wo us se apney (chehrey) malta aur jo us mein se kuchh na paata wo apne saathi key haath ki tari se leta. Phir main ne Bilaal ko dekha ke unhon-ne nezah liya aur use gaad diya. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke surkh joda pehney aasteenein chadhaaey huey they. Aap ne nezey ki taraf logon ko do rakatein padhaaein. Aur main ne logon aur jaanvaron ko nezey key saamney se guzartey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 376)"
"249","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai aur un se poochha gaya tha: Mimbar kis cheez se hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Logon mein mujh se zyada jaanney wala koi baaqi nahi raha. Wo jungle key jhaoo se hai. Use fulaan ne jo fulaana key aazaad karda ghulaam hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye banaaya tha. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us par khadey huey jab wo banaaya gaya aur rakkha gaya. To Aap ne qibley ki taraf munh kya aur takbeer kahi aur log Aap key peechey khadey huey. To Aap ne qiraat ki aur ruku kya aur logon ne Aap key peechey ruku kya. Phir Aap ne apna sar uthaaya phir peechey hattey huey wapas aey aur zameen par sajda kya. Phir mimbar ki taraf wapas aey phir ruku kya phir apna sar uthaaya phir peechey hattey huey wapas aey yahan tak ke zameen par sajda kya. To ye Aap ka maamla tha. (Bukhari: 337)"
"250","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unki daadi Ulaika ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khaaney ki daawat di jo unhon-ne Aap key liye banaaya tha. To Aap ne us mein se khaaya, phir farmaya: Utho taake main tumhey namaz padhaaun. Anas ne kaha: To main hamaari aik chaataai ki taraf utha jo itna pehna gaya tha ke kaali ho gai thi. To main ne us par paani chhidka. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur main ne aur yateem ne Aap key peechey saf banaai aur budhiya hamaarey peechey (khadi hui). To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein do rakatein padhaaein phir phir gaey. (Bukhari: 380)"
"251","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key saamney soti thi jabke merey donon paon Aap key qibley mein hotey. Phir jab Aap sajda kartey to mujhey chubhtey aur main apney paon samet leti. Phir jab Aap khadey hotey to unhey phaila deti. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ghar us din chiraaghon se khaali they. (Bukhari: 382)"
"252","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padhtey they jabke wo Aap key aur qibley key darmiyaan ghar key bistar par janaazey ki tarah aadi leti hotein. (Bukhari: 383)"
"253","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padhtey they. To ham mein se koi sakht garmi ki wajah se apne kapdey ka kinaara sajdey ki jagah mein rakkhta. (Bukhari: 385)"
"254","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne jooton mein namaz padhtey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. (Bukhari: 386)"
"255","[AI-translation] Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne peshaab kya phir wuzu kya aur moozon par masah kya, phir khadey huey aur namaz padhi. To un se poochha gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa kartey huey dekha hai. To unhey taajjub hua kyunke Jareer sab se aakhir mein Musalman honay walon mein se they. (Bukhari: 387)"
"256","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Maalik bin Buhaina (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab namaz padhtey to apne donon haathon key darmiyaan faasla kartey yahan tak ke Aap ki baghalon ki safedi zaahir hoti. (Bukhari: 390)"
"257","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamaari namaz padhey aur hamaarey qibley ki taraf munh karey aur hamaara zibeeha khaey to wo Musalman hai jiskey liye Allah ka zimma aur uskey Rasool ka zimma hai. To Allah ko uskey zimmey mein dhoka na do. (Bukhari: 391)"
"258","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se aik aadmi key baarey mein poochha gaya jis ne Umrah key liye Bait ka tawaaf kya aur Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan tawaaf na kya, kya wo apni biwi key paas jaa sakta hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey aur Bait ka saat martaba tawaaf kya aur Maqaam key peechey do rakatein padhein aur Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan tawaaf kya. Aur beshak tumharey liye Rasulullah mein umda namoona tha. (Bukhari: 395)"
"259","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bait mein daakhil huey to uskey tamaam konon mein dua ki aur namaz na padhi yahan tak ke us se nikley. Phir jab nikley to Kaaba key saamney do rakatein padhein aur farmaya: Ye qibla hai. (Bukhari: 398)"
"260","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf solah ya satrah mahiney namaz padhi. Ye guzar chuki hai aur donon key darmiyaan lafzon mein ikhtelaaf hai. (Bukhari: 399)"
"261","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawaari par namaz padhtey they jidhar wo rukh karti. Phir jab farz (namaz) ka iraada kartey to utartey aur qibley ki taraf munh kartey. (Bukhari: 400)"
"262","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Alqama se riwayat karney waley Ibrahim ne jo Ibn Masood se riwayat kartey hain kaha: Mujhey nahi maloom: Zyaada ki ya kam ki. Phir jab Aap ne salaam phera to Aap se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya namaz mein koi nai baat hui hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aur wo kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne aisa aisa padha. To Aap ne apney paon modey aur qibley ki taraf munh kya aur do sajdey kiye phir salaam phera. Phir jab Aap apne chehrey key sath hamaari taraf mutawajjeh huey to farmaya: Beshak agar namaz mein koi nai baat hoti to main tumhey uski khabar deta. Lekin beshak main tumhaari tarah bashar hun, bhoolta hun jaisey tum bhooltey ho. Phir jab main bhoolun to mujhey yaad dilaao. Aur jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak karey to use durust baat talaash karni chaahiye aur use us par poora karna chaahiye, phir salaam pherna chaahiye, phir do sajdey karney chaahiyein. (Bukhari: 401)"
"263","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main apne Rab key muwaafiq teen (baaton) mein hua. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaash ham Maqaam-e-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah bana lein. To naazil hui: (Aur Maqaam-e-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah banao). Aur Hijaab ki aayat: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaash Aap apni biwiyon ko hukm dein ke wo parda karein, kyunke un se nek aur badkaar baat kartey hain. To Hijaab ki aayat naazil hui. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyaan Aap par ghairat mein jama huin to main ne un se kaha: (Qareeb hai ke uska Rab agar wo tumhey talaaq dey dey to tumhey tum se behtar biwiyaan badley mein dey dey). To ye aayat naazil hui. (Bukhari: 402)"
"264","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qibley mein thook dekha. To wo Aap par giraan guzra yahan tak ke Aap key chehrey mein dekha gaya. To Aap uthay aur use apne haath se ragad diya. To farmaya: Beshak tum mein se koi jab apni namaz mein khada hota hai to beshak wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai, ya beshak uska Rab uskey aur qibley key darmiyaan hai. To tum mein se koi apne qibley key saamney na thookey, lekin apne baaen taraf ya apne qadmon key neechey. Phir Aap ne apni chaadar ka kinaara liya aur us mein thooka phir uskey baaz ko baaz par mod diya aur farmaya: Ya aisa karey. (Bukhari: 405)"
"265","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah aur Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhuma) se thook ki hadees (marwi hai) aur us mein izaafa hai: Aur na apne daaen taraf. (Bukhari: 408, 409)"
"266","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Masjid mein thookna gunaah hai aur uska kaffaara use dafan karna hai. (Bukhari: 415)"
"267","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mera qibla yahaan dekhtey ho? To Allah ki qasam! Mujh se tumhaara khushu aur tumhaara ruku chhupa hua nahi hai. Beshak main tumhey apni peeth key peechey se dekhta hun. (Bukhari: 418)"
"268","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un ghodon key darmiyaan daud karaai jo daud key liye tayyaar kiye gaey they, Hafya se. Aur unki had Saniyat-ul-Wada thi. Aur un ghodon key darmiyaan daud karaai jo tayyaar na kiye gaey they, Saniya se Bani Zuraiq ki masjid tak. Aur Abdullah bin Umar un mein they jo un par daud mein shareek huey. (Bukhari: 420)"
"269","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Bahrein se maal laaya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use masjid mein bikher do. Aur wo sab se zyada maal tha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laaya gaya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz key liye nikley aur uski taraf tawajjoh na ki. Phir jab Aap namaz poori kar chukey to aey aur uskey paas baith gaey. To Aap kisi ko na dekhtey magar use detey. Jabke Aap key paas Abbas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey dijiye, beshak main ne apne aap ka fidya diya aur Aqeel ka fidya diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Lo. To unhon-ne apne kapdey mein bhara. Phir use uthaanay chaley to taaqat na rakkhey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Un mein se kisi ko hukm dijiye ke wo use mujh par uthaaey. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap use mujh par uthaaeeye. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. To unhon-ne us mein se bikhera, phir use uthaaya aur apne kandhey par daala, phir chaley. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) musalsal unhey apni nigaah se dekhtey rahey yahan tak ke wo ham se chhup gaey, unki hirs par taajjub se. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na uthay jabke us mein se dirham tha. (Bukhari: 421)"
"270","[AI-translation] Mehmood bin Rabee Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Itbaan bin Maalik jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se they, un mein se jo Badr mein Ansaar mein se shareek huey, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri beenaai kam ho gai hai aur main apni qaum ko namaz padhaata hun. Phir jab baarishein hotein to wo naala jo merey aur unkey darmiyaan hai behney lagta to main unki masjid mein aa kar unhey namaz na padha sakta. Aur main chahta hun Ya Rasulullah ke Aap merey paas aaein aur merey ghar mein namaz padhein to main use namaz ki jagah bana lun. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Main karunga agar Allah ne chaaha. Itbaan ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr subah din chadhney key baad aey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ijazat maangi aur main ne Aap ko ijazat di. To Aap ghar mein daakhil honay se pehley na baithey, phir farmaya: Tum apne ghar mein se kahaan pasand kartey ho ke main namaz padhun? Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Aap ko ghar key aik koney ki taraf ishaara kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur takbeer kahi. To ham khadey huey aur ham ne safein banaaein. To Aap ne do rakatein padhein phir salaam phera. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ham ne Aap ko khazeera par rok liya jo ham ne Aap key liye banaaya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To ghar mein ghar walon mein se kayi aadmi aey aur jama huey. To un mein se aik kehney waley ne kaha: Maalik bin Dukhaishan ya Ibn Dukhsan kahaan hai? To baaz ne kaha: Wo munaafiq hai jo Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat nahi rakhta. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ke us ne La ilaaha illallah kaha hai, us se Allah ka chehra chahta hua. Us ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaanney waley hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To beshak ham uska chehra aur uski khairkhwaahi munaafiqon ki taraf dekhtey hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To beshak Allah ne aag par usey haraam kar diya hai jis ne La ilaaha illallah kaha, us se Allah ka chehra chahta hua. (Bukhari: 425)"
"271","[AI-translation] Aisha Ummul Momineen (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Umm Habeeba aur Umm Salma (Raziallahu anhuma) ne aik girja ka zikr kya jo unhon-ne Habsha mein dekha tha jis mein tasweerein thein. To un donon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo log jab un mein nek aadmi hota aur wo mar jaata to uski qabr par masjid banaatey aur us mein wo tasweerein banaatey. To wo Qiyaamat key din Allah key paas makhlooq mein sab se burey hongey. (Bukhari: 427)"
"272","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashreef laaey aur Madina key baalaai hissey mein aik mohalley mein utrey jinhey Banu Amr bin Auf kaha jaata hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un mein chaudah raatein thehrey. Phir Aap ne Bani Najjaar ko bulwa bheja. To wo talwaarein gardanon mein daaley huey aey. Goya main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Aapki sawaari par dekh raha hun jabke Abu Bakr Aap key peechey sawaar hain aur Bani Najjaar key sardaar Aap key gird hain. Yahan tak ke Aap ne Abu Ayyub key sehan mein apna saamaan rakkha. Aur Aap pasand kartey they ke jahaan namaz paa ley wahaan namaz padhein, aur bakriyon key baadon mein namaz padhtey. Aur Aap ne masjid banaaney ka hukm diya. To Aap ne Bani Najjaar key sardaaron ko bulwa bheja aur farmaya: Ae Bani Najjaar! Apni ye deewaar mujh se qeemat par becho. Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Ham uski qeemat sirf Allah se maangtey hain. To Anas ne kaha: To us mein tha jo main tumhey kehta hun: Mushrikeen ki qabrein aur us mein veeraana aur us mein khajoorein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mushrikeen ki qabron ka hukm diya aur wo khodi gaein. Phir veeraaney ka to baraabar kar diya gaya aur khajooron ka to kaat di gaein. To khajooron ko masjid key qibley ki taraf saf mein rakkha. Aur uskey donon baazoo patthar key banaaey. Aur wo patthar uthaatey they jabke rajaz padhtey they aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey sath they jabke Aap farma rahey they: Ae Allah! Bhalai nahi magar Aakhirat ki bhalai, to Ansaar aur Muhaajireen ko maaf farma."
"273","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo apne oont ki taraf (sutra bana kar) namaz padhtey they. Aur unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa kartey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 430)"
"274","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh par aag pesh ki gai jabke main namaz padh raha tha. (Bukhari: 431)"
"275","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein apni namaz mein se (hissa) rakkho aur unhey qabrein na banao. (Bukhari: 432)"
"276","[AI-translation] Aisha aur Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhum) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par (marz) naazil hua to Aap apni chaadar apne chehrey par daalney lagey. Phir jab Aap ko us se ghabrahat hoti to use apne chehrey se hata detey aur farmatey jabke Aap aise they: Yahood aur Nasaara par Allah ki laanat ho, unhon-ne apne Nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya. Unkey kiye se daraatey huey. (Bukhari: 435)"
"277","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Arbon key aik qabeelay ki aik kaali londi thi. To unhon-ne usey aazaad kar diya aur wo unkey sath thi. Unhon-ne kaha: To unki aik chhoti bachchi nikli jis par chamdey key tasmon ka surkh haar tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne use rakkha ya wo us se gir gaya. To uskey paas se cheel guzri jabke wo pada hua tha. To us ne use gosht samjha aur jhapat liya. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne use talaash kya aur na paaya. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne mujh par uska ilzaam lagaaya. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo talashi leney lagey yahan tak ke unhon-ne uskey aagey (hissaa) ki talashi li. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Allah ki qasam! Beshak main unkey sath khadi thi ke cheel guzri aur us ne use phenk diya. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo unkey darmiyaan gira. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Yehi hai jiskey baarey mein tum ne mujh par ilzaam lagaaya tha, tum ne gumaan kya tha jabke main us se bari hun aur ye wo hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur Musalman ho gai. Aisha ne kaha: To masjid mein uskey liye khema tha ya jhonpdi. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo merey paas aati aur merey paas baat karti. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo merey paas koi majlis na baithti magar kehti: Aur haar wala din hamaarey Rab key ajaaebaat mein se hai, khabardaar! Beshak us ne mujhey kufr key shehar se najaat di. Aisha ne kaha: To main ne us se kaha: Tumhara kya haal hai ke tum merey sath koi majlis nahi baithtin magar ye kehtin ho? Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne mujhey ye hadees sunaai. (Bukhari: 439)"
"278","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Faatima key ghar tashreef laaey aur Ali ko ghar mein na paaya. To farmaya: Tumharey chacha ka beta kahaan hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Merey aur unkey darmiyaan kuchh hua aur unhon-ne mujh se naaraazgi ki aur nikley aur merey paas dopahar ko na soey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik insaan se farmaya: Dekho wo kahaan hai? To wo aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo masjid mein soey huey hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aey jabke wo letey huey they. Aap ki chaadar unkey pehlu se gir gai thi aur unhey mitti lag gai thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey un se saaf karney lagey aur farmatey they: Utho Abu Turaab! Utho Abu Turaab! (Bukhari: 441)"
"279","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada Sulami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein daakhil ho to baithney se pehley do rakatein padhey. (Bukhari: 444)"
"280","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak masjid Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein kachchi eenton se bani hui thi aur uski chhat khajoor ki shaakhon ki thi aur uskey sutoon khajoor ki lakdi key they. To Abu Bakr ne us mein kuchh izaafa na kya. Aur Umar ne us mein izaafa kya aur use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney ki banaawat par kachchi eenton aur khajoor ki shaakhon se banaaya aur uskey sutoon lakdi key banaaey. Phir Usmaan ne use badal diya aur us mein bahut izaafa kya aur uski deewaar naqshdaar pattharon aur chooney se banaai aur uskey sutoon naqshdaar pattharon se banaaey aur uski chhat saagwaan se banaai. (Bukhari: 446)"
"281","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo aik din bayan kar rahey they yahan tak ke masjid ki taameer ka zikr aaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham aik aik eent uthaatey they aur Ammaar do do eentein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey dekha aur un se mitti jhaadney lagey aur farmatey they: Ammaar par afsos! Use baaghi giroh qatl karega. Wo unhey Jannat ki taraf bulaata hai aur wo usey aag ki taraf bulaatey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Ammaar kehtey hain: Main fitnon se Allah ki panaah maangta hun. (Bukhari: 447)"
"282","[AI-translation] Usmaan bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, logon key unkey baarey mein kehney key waqt jab unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki masjid banaai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tum ne bahut kaha. Aur beshak main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo masjid banaaey aur us se Allah ka chehra chaahaaey to Allah uskey liye Jannat mein us jaisi banaaeyga. (Bukhari: 450)"
"283","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Aik aadmi masjid mein guzra jabke uskey sath teer they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Unkey phal pakad lo. (Bukhari: 451)"
"284","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo hamaari masjidon ya baazaaron mein se kisi mein teer ley kar guzrey to use unkey phal pakadney chaahiyein taake apni hatheli se kisi Musalman ko zakhmi na karey. (Bukhari: 452)"
"285","[AI-translation] Hassaan bin Saabit Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) ko gawaah banaaya: Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun, kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna hai: Ae Hassaan! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se jawaab do. Ae Allah! Rooh-ul-Qudus key sath uski taaeed farma? Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Haan. (Bukhari: 453)"
"286","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik din apne hujrey key darwaazey par dekha jabke Habsha waley masjid mein khel rahey they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey apni chaadar se parda kar rahey they taake main unkey khel ko dekhun. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Apne bhhalon se khel rahey they. (Bukhari: 454)"
"287","[AI-translation] Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Ibn Abi Hadrad se apna qarz jo unkey zimmey tha masjid mein maanga. To un donon ki aawaazein buland ho gaein yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey suna jabke Aap apne ghar mein they. To Aap un donon ki taraf nikley yahan tak ke Aap ne apne hujrey ka parda khola aur pukaara: Ae Kaab! Unhon-ne kaha: Haaazir hun Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Apne qarz mein se ye kam kar do. Aur uski taraf ishaara kya: Yaani aadha. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne kar diya. Aap ne farmaya: Utho aur use ada karo. (Bukhari: 457)"
"288","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik kaala aadmi ya kaali aurat masjid mein jhaadu detey they. To wo faut ho gaey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Wo faut ho gaey. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne mujhey uskey baarey mein khabar kyun na di? Mujhey uski qabr dikhaao. Ya uskey qaul uski qabr ka. To Aap uski qabr par aey aur us par (janaazey ki namaz) padhi. (Bukhari: 458)"
"289","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Surah Baqarah mein sood key baarey mein aayatein naazil huin to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid ki taraf nikley aur unhey logon par padha. Phir sharaab ki tijaarat haraam kar di. (Bukhari: 459)"
"290","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jinon mein se aik sarkash pichhli raat mujh par (hamla karkey) zaahir hua ya us jaisa kalimat, taake meri namaz kaat dey. To Allah ne mujhey us par qaabu dey diya. To main ne chaaha ke use masjid key sutunon mein se aik sutun se baandh dun yahan tak ke tum subah karo aur tum sab usey dekho. Phir mujhey merey bhai Sulaiman ka qaul yaad aaya: (Ae merey Rab! Mujhey aisi baadshahat dey jo merey baad kisi key laaeq na ho). (Bukhari: 461)"
"291","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Saad Khandaq key din kohni ki rag mein zakhmi huey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid mein unkey liye khema lagaa diya taake qareeb se unki ayaadat karein. To unhey Bani Ghifaar key masjid mein khemey walon key siva kisi ne na daraaya magar khoon unki taraf behta hua. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae khemey walon! Ye kya hai jo tumhaari taraf se hamaari taraf aa raha hai? Phir Saad ka zakhm khoon behney laga aur wo us mein faut ho gaey. (Bukhari: 463)"
"292","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se shikaayat ki ke main beemaar hun. Aap ne farmaya: Logon key peechey sawaar ho kar tawaaf karo. To main ne tawaaf kya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bait key pehlu mein namaz padh rahey they aur (Toor aur likhi hui Kitaab) padh rahey they. (Bukhari: 464)"
"293","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se do aadmi andheri raat mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se nikley jabke unkey sath do chiraaghon jaisi (roshni) thi jo unkey aagey roshni karti thi. Phir jab wo juda huey to un mein se har aik key sath aik ho gai yahan tak ke wo apne ghar walon key paas aaya. (Bukhari: 465)"
"294","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutba diya aur farmaya: Beshak Allah ne aik bandey ko duniya aur jo uskey paas hai uskey darmiyaan ikhtiyaar diya. To us ne jo Allah key paas hai use pasand kya. To Abu Bakr Siddique (Raziallahu anhu) roey. To main ne apne dil mein kaha: Is budhey ko kya rulaata hai? Agar Allah ne aik bandey ko duniya aur jo uskey paas hai uskey darmiyaan ikhtiyaar diya to us ne jo Allah key paas hai use pasand kya? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hi wo bandey they aur Abu Bakr ham mein sab se zyada jaanney waley they. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr! Na roo. Beshak apni sohbat aur apne maal mein mujh par sab se zyada ehsaan karney waley logon mein Abu Bakr hain. Aur agar main apni ummat mein se kisi ko khaleel banaata to Abu Bakr ko banaata, lekin Islam ki bhai chaargi aur uski mohabbat (kaafi hai). Masjid mein koi darwaaza baaqi na rahey magar band kar diya jaey, Abu Bakr key darwaazey key siwa. (Bukhari: 466)"
"295","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne us marz mein nikley jis mein Aap faut huey jabke Aap ne apna sar kapdey se baandha hua tha. To mimbar par baithey aur Allah ki hamd ki aur us par sana ki. Phir farmaya: Beshak logon mein se apni jaan aur apne maal mein mujh par Abu Bakr bin Abi Quhaafa se badh kar ehsaan karney wala koi nahi hai. Aur agar main logon mein se kisi ko khaleel banaata to Abu Bakr ko khaleel banaata, lekin Islam ki dosti afzal hai. Meri taraf se is masjid mein har khidki band kar do, Abu Bakr ki khidki key siwa. (Bukhari: 467)"
"296","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makkah tashreef laaey. To Usmaan bin Talha ko bulaaya aur us ne darwaaza khola. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Bilaal aur Usaama bin Zaid aur Usmaan bin Talha daakhil huey. Phir darwaaza band kar diya. To us mein ghadi bhar thehrey phir nikley. Ibn Umar ne kaha: To main dauda aur Bilaal se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne us mein (namaz) padhi. To main ne kaha: Kis (jagah)? Unhon-ne kaha: Do sutunon key darmiyaan. Ibn Umar ne kaha: To mujh se reh gaya ke main un se poochhun ke Aap ne kitni padhi. (Bukhari: 468)"
"297","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha jabke Aap mimbar par they: Raat ki namaz key baarey mein Aap kya kehtey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Do do (rakatein). Phir jab Subah ka khauf ho to aik (rakat) padhey to wo uskey liye jo us ne padha witr bana degi. Aur beshak wo kehtey they: Apni aakhri namaz witr banao. Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska hukm diya hai. (Bukhari: 472)"
"298","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid mein letey huey dekha jabke Aap ne apna aik paon doosrey par rakkha hua tha. (Bukhari: 475)"
"299","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jamaat ki namaz uski apne ghar mein namaz aur apne baazaar mein namaz par pachees darjey badhti hai. Beshak tum mein se koi jab wuzu karey aur wuzu achhi tarah karey aur masjid mein aaey aur sirf namaz ka iraada rakkhey to wo koi qadam na uthaeyga magar Allah uskey zariye uska darja buland karega aur us se gunaah mita dega yahan tak ke wo masjid mein daakhil ho. Aur jab wo masjid mein daakhil ho to namaz mein hota hai jab tak (namaz) use rokey. Aur farishtey us par durood bhejtey hain jab tak wo apni us majlis mein hai jis mein wo namaz padhta hai: Ae Allah! Use maaf farma, Ae Allah! Us par rehem farma. Jab tak wo us mein hadas na karey. (Bukhari: 477). Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Amr! Tumhara kya haal hoga jab tum logon key ghatiya hisson mein baaqi reh jaaogey. (480). Bukhari ne use musnad ghair muttasil sanad key sath zikr kya hai. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"300","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak momin momin key liye imaarat ki tarah hai, uska baaz baaz ko mazboot karta hai. Aur Aap ne apni ungliyaan aik doosrey mein daalein. (Bukhari: 481)"
"301","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein din ki do namazon mein se aik padhaai. To ham ne Aap key sath do rakatein padhein phir Aap ne salaam phera. To Aap masjid mein padi hui lakdi ki taraf uthay aur us par tek lagaaey goya ghussa honay waley. Aur apna daayaan haath apne baaen par rakkha aur ungliyon mein ungilyaan daalein aur apna daayaan rukhsaar apni baaen hatheli ki peeth par rakkha. Aur jaldbaaz masjid key darwaazon se nikley aur unhon-ne kaha: Kya namaz kam ho gai? Aur qaum mein Abu Bakr aur Umar they. To wo un se baat karney se darey. Aur qaum mein aik aadmi tha jiskey haathon mein lambaai thi jisey Zul Yadain kaha jaata hai. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Aap bhool gaey ya namaz kam ho gai? Aap ne farmaya: Na main bhoola aur na kam hui. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya jaisa Zul Yadain kehta hai (waisa hai)? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To Aap aagey badhey aur jo chhoda tha padha, phir salaam phera, phir takbeer kahi aur apne sajdey jaisa ya us se lamba sajda kya, phir apna sar uthaaya aur takbeer kahi, phir takbeer kahi aur apne sajdey jaisa ya us se lamba sajda kya, phir apna sar uthaaya aur takbeer kahi, phir salaam phera. (Bukhari: 482)"
"302","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo raastey ki jaghon mein namaz padhtey they aur kehtey they ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko un jaghon mein namaz padhtey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 483)"
"303","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zul Hulaifa mein utartey they jab Umrah kartey aur apne Hajj mein jab Hajj kartey, keekar key darkht key neechey us masjid ki jagah mein jo Zul Hulaifa mein hai. Aur Aap jab ghazwa se wapas aatey to us raastey mein ya Hajj ya Umrah se, naaley key pet se utartey. Phir jab naaley key pet se zaahir hotey to Batha mein oont bithaatey jo waadi key mashriqi kinaarey par hai. Phir subah tak wahaan rehtey. Na us masjid key paas jo pattharon ki hai aur na us teelay par jis par masjid hai. Wahaan naala tha, Abdullah uskey paas namaz padhtey they, uskey pet mein teelay they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahaan namaz padhtey they. Phir sailaab ne us mein Batha baha di yahan tak ke us jagah ko dafan kar diya jahaan Abdullah namaz padhtey they. (Bukhari: 484)"
"304","[AI-translation] Aur Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahaan namaz padhi jahaan chhoti masjid hai jo us masjid se neechey hai jo Rauha key buland hissey mein hai. Aur Abdullah us jagah ko jaantey they jahaan Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi thi. Wo kehtey hain: Phir tumhaarey daaen taraf jab tum masjid mein khadey ho kar namaz padho. Aur wo masjid raastey key daaen kinaarey par hai jabke tum Makkah ki taraf jaa rahey ho. Uskey aur badi masjid key darmiyaan patthar phenkney ki doori hai ya us jaisa. (Bukhari: 485)"
"305","[AI-translation] Aur Abdullah bin Umar Rauha key mod par nashtar key paas namaz padhtey they. Aur wo nashtar uskey kinaarey ka aakhir hai raastey key kinaarey par, us masjid se neechey jo uskey aur mod key darmiyaan hai jabke tum Makkah ki taraf jaa rahey ho. Aur wahaan masjid bana di gai hai. To Abdullah bin Umar us masjid mein namaz na padhtey they. Wo use apne baaen aur peechey chhorey rakhtey they aur uskey saamney nashtar ki taraf namaz padhtey they. Aur Abdullah Rauha se shaam ko chaltey aur Zohar na padhtey yahan tak ke us jagah aatey aur us mein Zohar padhtey. Aur jab Makkah se aatey to agar uskey paas Subah se aik ghanta pehley ya aakhri sehri mein guzartey to wahaan rehtey yahan tak ke wahaan Subah padhtey. (Bukhari: 486)"
"306","[AI-translation] Aur Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ruwaysa se neechey raastey key daaen taraf aur raastey key saamney khuli chapti jagah mein badey keekar key darkht key neechey utartey they, yahan tak ke Ruwaysa key daak khaaney se do meel neechey teelay se nikaltey. Aur uska upar ka hissa toot chuka tha to uskey pet mein mud gaya tha jabke wo taney par khada tha aur uskey taney mein bahut teelay they. (Bukhari: 487)"
"307","[AI-translation] Aur Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne bayan kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Arj key peechey naaley key kinaarey namaz padhi jabke tum teelay ki taraf jaa rahey ho. Us masjid key paas do ya teen qabrein hain. Qabron par raastey key daaen taraf raastey key keekaron key paas pattharon ka dher hai, un keekaron key darmiyaan. Abdullah Arj se shaam ko chaltey they, jab dopahar mein sooraj dhal jaata to us masjid mein Zohar padhtey. (Bukhari: 488)"
"308","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raastey key baaen taraf keekaron key paas naaley mein utrey jo Harsha se neechey hai. Wo naala Harsha ki choti se chipka hua hai. Uskey aur raastey key darmiyaan teer phenkney key qareeb faasla hai. Aur Abdullah us keekar ki taraf namaz padhtey they jo keekaron mein raastey se qareeb tareen aur sab se lamba tha. (Bukhari: 489)"
"309","[AI-translation] Aur wo kehtey hain: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us naaley mein utartey they jo Marr-uz-Zahraan key neechey Madina ki taraf hai jab Safrawaaton se utartey. Us naaley key pet mein utartey raastey key baaen taraf jabke tum Makkah ki taraf jaa rahey ho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key thikaaney aur raastey key darmiyaan patthar phenkney key siwa (faasla) nahi hai. (Bukhari: 490)"
"310","[AI-translation] Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zu Tuwa mein utartey they aur raat guzaartey yahan tak ke subah hoti. Jab Makkah tashreef laatey to Subah padhtey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka musalla sakht teelay par tha. Na us masjid mein jo wahaan banaai gai hai, lekin us se neechey sakht teelay par. (Bukhari: 491)"
"311","[AI-translation] Aur Abdullah bin Umar bayan kartey hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pahaad key donon raaston ki taraf mutawajjeh huey jo uskey aur lambey pahaad key darmiyaan hai, Kaaba ki taraf. To us masjid ko jo wahaan banaai gai hai masjid key baaen taraf teelay key kinaarey par banaaya. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka musalla us se neechey kaaley teelay par hai. Teelay mein se das haath ya us jaisa chhoro phir namaz padho, pahaad key donon raaston ki taraf munh kar key jo tumharey aur Kaaba key darmiyaan hai. (Bukhari: 492)"
"312","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Eid key din nikaltey to nezey ka hukm detey aur wo Aap key saamney rakkha jaata. To Aap uski taraf (munh kar key) namaz padhtey jabke log Aap key peechey hotey. Aur Aap safar mein aisa kartey they. To usi se hukmraanon ne use apnaaya. (Bukhari: 494)"
"313","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey Batha mein namaz padhaai jabke Aap key saamney nezah tha. Zohar ki do rakatein aur Asr ki do rakatein. Aap key saamney se aurat aur gadha guzartey they. (Bukhari: 495)"
"314","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key musalley aur deewar key darmiyaan bakri guzarney ki jagah thi. (Bukhari: 496)"
"315","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apni haajat key liye nikaltey to main aur aik ladka Aap key peechey chaltey jabke hamaarey sath ukkaaz ya laathi ya nezah hota. Aur hamaarey sath mashkiza hota. Phir jab Aap apni haajat se faarigh hotey to ham Aap ko mashkiza detey. (Bukhari: 500)"
"316","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo us sutun key paas namaz padhtey they jo Quran (key nuskhey) key paas hai. To un se kaha gaya: Ae Abu Muslim! Main tumhey dekhta hun ke tum is sutun key paas namaz ka ehtemaam kartey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: To beshak main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uskey paas namaz ka ehtemaam kartey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 502)"
"317","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kaaba mein daakhil huey jabke Usaama bin Zaid aur Bilaal aur Usmaan bin Talha Hijabi (bhi they). To us ne use Aap par band kar diya aur us mein thehrey. To main ne Bilaal se poochha jab wo nikley: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne aik sutun apne baaen taraf aur aik sutun apne daaen taraf aur teen sutun apne peechey kiye. Aur Bait us din chhe sutunon par tha. Phir (Aap ne namaz) padhi. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Apne daaen taraf do sutun. (Bukhari: 505)"
"318","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap apni oontni ko aade rakhtey aur uski taraf (munh kar key) namaz padhtey. Nafe se poochha gaya: Bataaiye agar oont bhaag jaaein? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo ye kajawa letey aur use seedha kartey aur uskey pichhley hissey ki taraf (munh kar key) namaz padhtey. Ya unhon-ne kaha uskey pichhley hissey ki taraf. Aur Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) aisa kartey they. (Bukhari: 507)"
"319","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum ne hamein kuttey aur gadhey key baraabar kar diya? Beshak main bistar par aadi leti hui thi. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aatey aur bistar key darmiyaan mein (khade ho kar) namaz padhtey. To main naapasand karti ke Aap key saamney aaun. To main bistar key pairon ki taraf se nikalti yahan tak ke apne lihaaf se nikal jaati. (Bukhari: 508)"
"320","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Jumuah key din namaz padh rahey they kisi cheez ki taraf jo unhey logon se parda karti thi. To Bani Abi Muait ka aik jawan chaaha ke unkey saamney se guzrey. To Abu Saeed ne uskey seeney mein dhakka diya. To jawan ne dekha aur usey unkey saamney key siwa koi raasta na mila. To wo guzarney key liye wapas aaya to Abu Saeed ne use pehli se zyada zor se dhakka diya. To us ne Abu Saeed se badsulooki ki, phir Marwaan key paas daakhil hua aur us se jo Abu Saeed se paaya tha shikaayat ki. Aur Abu Saeed uskey peechey Marwaan key paas daakhil huey. To us ne kaha: Tumhey aur apne bhatijey key sath kya hua ae Abu Saeed? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum mein se koi aisi cheez ki taraf namaz padhey jo use logon se parda karti ho, phir koi uskey saamney se guzarna chaahaaey to use dhakka dey. Phir agar wo inkaar karey to us se ladey, beshak wo shaitaan hai. (Bukhari: 509)"
"321","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar namazi key saamney se guzarney wala jaanta ke us par kya hai to chaalees theharna uskey liye uskey saamney se guzarney se behtar hota. Raawi ne kaha: Mujhey nahi maloom Aap ne farmaya: Chaalees din ya mahina ya saal. (Bukhari: 510)"
"322","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padhtey they jabke main unkey bistar par aadi soyi hui hoti. Phir jab Aap witr padhna chaahtey to mujhey jagaatey aur main witr padhti. (Bukhari: 512)"
"323","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padhtey they jabke Aap Umaama bint Zainab bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uthaey huey they, aur Abul Aas bin Rabeea bin Abd Shams (key liye). Phir jab Aap sajda kartey to usey rakh detey aur jab khadey hotey to usey utha letey. (Bukhari: 516)"
"324","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Quraish par baddua key baarey mein jis din unhon-ne Aap par ojhdi rakkhi guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan uskey aakhir mein farmaya: Phir wo Badr key kuwein ki taraf ghaseetey gaey. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur kuwein walon key saathiyon par laanat ki pairwi karaai gai. (Bukhari: 520). Kitaab-u-Mawaaqeet-is-Salaat."
